	(text "Switched rails: +5V and +3.3V stay up parked (3.3 V is made from 5 V), so everything that only matters while" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.00 170.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "1066567d-2b47-4ab4-8c0b-30a5bdc06c28"))
	(text "running hangs off +5V_SW / +3.3V_SW: driver buffers, MAX9926, ADC, op-amps, mux, TFT and VR pull-ups. Always on:" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.00 174.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "c43c2572-c419-4642-9b91-72f24ab43fe2"))
	(text "MCU, watchdog, CAN transceiver (wake), SCP receiver, input clamps, SD switch. TPS22917: slew-limited, no inrush dip on the MCU rail." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.00 178.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "b708848d-9b4c-4f0b-b988-af1e3c6fedc5"))
